  "description": "Universal PID process controller with ramp and soak, four alarms, analog output and optional RS485 Modbus RTU: PV, setpoints, output power, status, PID, input, alarms, I/O and serial settings",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-10-31",
  "firmware": "Instruction manual V3.0x P",
  "source": "Novus N2000 controller instruction manual V3.0x P (Portuguese), annex 1",
